ul or offensive content\",\"zh-Hans\":\"有害或冒犯性内容\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportMisleading\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Misleading or incorrect content\",\"zh-Hans\":\"误导或错误内容\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportPrivacy\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Privacy concern\",\"zh-Hans\":\"隐私问题\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportOther\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Other\",\"zh-Hans\":\"其他\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportComment\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Additional details (optional)\",\"zh-Hans\":\"补充说明（选填）\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportSubmit\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Submit report\",\"zh-Hans\":\"提交举报\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportSending\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Submitting…\",\"zh-Hans\":\"正在提交…\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportReceived\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Report submitted for safety review.\",\"zh-Hans\":\"举报已提交，等待安全审核。\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportFailed\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"The report was not confirmed. Check your connection and try again.\",\"zh-Hans\":\"尚未确认举报已提交，请检查网络后重试。\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportSignIn\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Your account session changed or expired. Sign in again before reporting.\",\"zh-Hans\":\"账号已切换或登录已过期，请重新登录后举报。\"},\"sources\":[]},\"common.aiReportLimit\":{\"namespace\":\"common\",\"parameters\":[],\"sourceRevision\":1,\"messages\":{\"en\":\"Too many reports were submitted recently. Please try again later.\",\"zh-Hans\":\"近期提交的举报过多，